+# Each coverage-hit indicator is reified with OnlyEnforceIf, which CP-SAT only
+# puts into its LP relaxation at linearization_level >= 2 (max_lp workers).
+# At the default level, and in every LNS subproblem, the LP sees no link
+# between coverage and the hit it pays for. The same implication written as a
+# plain linear row, coverage >= threshold * hit, is in the LP at level 1. It is
+# redundant for the integer model (coverage >= 0), so the feasible set is
+# unchanged; only the relaxation tightens. Source: OR-Tools v9.15
+# linear_relaxation.cc; evidence/LP_VISIBLE_HIT_LINKS.md.
+LP_VISIBLE_HIT_LINKS = True
